  <div class="site-container integration-overview__layout">
    <div>
      <p>Why integrations matter</p>

      <h2 id="integration-overview-title">
        Disconnected systems create invisible operational work.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="integration-overview__copy">
      <p>
        Businesses often use multiple systems for customers,
        finance, communications, payments, operations and
        reporting. When those systems do not communicate,
        information has to be copied, reconciled or manually
        checked.
      </p>

      <p>
        Integrations allow defined events and data to move
        between systems automatically while preserving business
        rules, status handling and accountability.
      </p>

      <p>
        The objective is not integration for its own sake.
        It is reducing duplicated work and making connected
        processes more dependable.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
